# ── Docs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Ignore all Markdown docs except the README and the LMS integration notes.
# LMS_INTEGRATION.md carries the API-key rotation warning - it must travel with
# the code, not sit on one machine.
#
# This also keeps CONTEXT.md and docs/PLATFORM-ANALYSIS.md off the remote,
# which matters: both quote live survey #22081 verbatim, including the
# policyholder's name, company, policy number and address. Scrub that before
# ever un-ignoring them.
*.md
!README.md
!LMS_INTEGRATION.md

# Local dev-only mock backend (usage tracking) - never ship this
dev-backend/

# ── Secrets / local config ──────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets.json

# ── Packed builds ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Chrome packaging output. The unpacked source is the deliverable.
*.zip
*.crx
*.pem
dist/
build/

# ── Tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log
*.log

# ── Editor / OS noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Agent scratch ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
